Multi-Agent Supply Chain Fixer

Multi-Agent Supply Chain Fixer is an AI-powered supply chain management system that uses multiple intelligent agents to monitor, analyze, and optimize supply chain operations in real time. The system helps businesses reduce delays, prevent stock shortages, improve supplier coordination, optimize inventory, and ensure timely product delivery through automated decision-making and predictive analytics.

Multi-Agent Supply Chain Fixer

Multi-Agent Supply Chain Fixer is a web-based platform designed to automate supply chain monitoring and management. It enables businesses to track inventory, suppliers, warehouses, shipments, and customer demand from a centralized dashboard. The system uses multiple AI agents to identify supply chain disruptions, predict potential risks, recommend corrective actions, and improve overall operational efficiency.

AI-Powered Multi-Agent Supply Chain Fixer

AI-powered Multi-Agent Supply Chain Fixer built using React, FastAPI, MongoDB, Python, and Multi-Agent AI to monitor inventory, manage suppliers, optimize logistics, predict demand, detect supply chain issues, and provide real-time business insights for supply chain managers.

